            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "EPTTIGGER"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe was awesome! I didn't have a teaball or cheesecloth bag so I put the cinnamon sticks &amp; cloves in a peeled orange...it worked well. The only other different thing I did was put the ingredients in a crock pot on low and I also dumped in a can of fruit cocktail for the kids...the house smelled delicious! This will defintely be a keeper around the holidays!!!"
          },
