            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "missyforbes"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for Thanksgiving and it was a huge hit with everyone, kids and adults. People were drinking 3 or 4 mugs and I made a whole 2nd double batch. I went the easy route and just dumped everything in my crock pot on high, sprinkled ground versions of the spices right in the punch and a few cinnamon sticks too and gave it a good stir. This will definitely be a tradition for our family's Thanksgivings from here out!",
            "datePublished": "2014-12-28T21:54:19.920Z"
          },
